{"html": "<header class=\"spec-title-strip\">\n<div class=\"spec-title-col\">\n<div class=\"spec-family-crumb\">\n            FAMILY 02 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">稠密预测与医学分割：从像素输出到自配置系统</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Dense Segmentation</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"spec-model-title\" id=\"model_007_3d_u_net-title\">3D U-Net</h3>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-text lang-zh\">把 U-Net 的卷积、池化、上采样和 long skip 全部扩展为原生 3D，并支持稀疏切片监督。</p>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-en lang-en\">Extends all U-Net convolutions, pooling, upsampling, and long skips to native 3D tensors with support for sparse slice annotations.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-tensor-col\">\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">INPUT DOMAIN // 输入域</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">3D CT/MRI 子体积或完整体数据</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">3D CT/MRI sub-volume or whole volumetric scan</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">OUTPUT TARGET // 输出目标</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">稠密 3D 体素分割</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Dense 3D voxel-wise segmentation volume</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header><div class=\"model-full-body\">\n<!-- Main Split: Original Figure Plate (Left) + Forward Computation Graph (Right) -->\n<div class=\"spec-blueprint-grid\">\n<section class=\"spec-figure-plate\">\n<div class=\"plate-header\">\n<div class=\"plate-header-left\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">PRIMARY FIGURE // Figure 2 · PDF p.4</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">论文原始架构图</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Original Paper Architecture Diagram</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"plate-header-right\">\n<a class=\"plate-source-link\" href=\"https://doi.org/10.1007/978-3-319-46723-8_49\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>SOURCE PDF</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n<button class=\"plate-zoom-btn\" onclick=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_007_3d_u_net')\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6M9 21H3v-6M21 3l-7 7M3 21l7-7\"></path></svg><span>FULLSCREEN LIGHTBOX</span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"arch-figure-box\" onclick=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_007_3d_u_net')\" title=\"Click to open interactive pan &amp; zoom viewer\">\n<img alt=\"3D U-Net original paper architecture figure, Figure 2\" class=\"arch-figure-img\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/f3e72a0c35b6fd3cf563.avif\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"plate-caption\">CLICK FIGURE TO OPEN INTERACTIVE PAN &amp; ZOOM VIEWER · Figure 2 · PDF p.4</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</section>\n<aside class=\"spec-circuit-panel\">\n<div class=\"circuit-header\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">COMPUTATION GRAPH // 9 STAGES</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">架构前向计算节点拆解</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Forward Pass Computation Nodes</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"circuit-controls\">\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" onclick=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_007_3d_u_net', -1)\" title=\"Previous Stage\" type=\"button\">◁</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn circuit-play-btn\" data-play-id=\"architecture_model_007_3d_u_net\" onclick=\"toggleAutoPlayNodes('architecture_model_007_3d_u_net')\" title=\"Auto-Trace Computation Graph\" type=\"button\">AUTO</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" onclick=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_007_3d_u_net', 1)\" title=\"Next Stage\" type=\"button\">▷</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"active-node-spotlight\" id=\"spotlight-architecture_model_007_3d_u_net\">\n<span class=\"spotlight-badge\">\n                STAGE 01 / 09 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">3D Volume</span><span class=\"lang-en\">3D Volume</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text lang-zh\">输入为 C×D×H×W 体数据而非独立切片。</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text spotlight-text-en lang-en\">Ingests 3d ct/mri sub-volume or whole volumetric scan and prepares initial tensor representations (3D Volume).</span>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"circuit-timeline\">\n<li class=\"circuit-node active\" data-node-desc=\"输入为 C×D×H×W 体数据而非独立切片。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Ingests 3d ct/mri sub-volume or whole volumetric scan and prepares initial tensor representations (3D Volume).\" data-node-idx=\"0\" data-node-name=\"3D Volume\" data-node-name-en=\"3D Volume\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_007_3d_u_net', 0)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">01</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>3D Volume</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">输入为 C×D×H×W 体数据而非独立切片。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Ingests 3d ct/mri sub-volume or whole volumetric scan and prepares initial tensor representations (3D Volume).</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"3×3×3 卷积同时聚合层内与层间邻域。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Executes 3D Conv Encoder to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.\" data-node-idx=\"1\" data-node-name=\"3D Conv Encoder\" data-node-name-en=\"3D Conv Encoder\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_007_3d_u_net', 1)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">02</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>3D Conv Encoder</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">3×3×3 卷积同时聚合层内与层间邻域。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Executes 3D Conv Encoder to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"体素三轴下采样扩大体积感受野。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs 3D Pool within the core volumetric u net computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"2\" data-node-name=\"3D Pool\" data-node-name-en=\"3D Pool\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_007_3d_u_net', 2)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">03</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>3D Pool</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">体素三轴下采样扩大体积感受野。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs 3D Pool within the core volumetric u net computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"编码器最低尺度建模器官形状与跨切片连续性。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Stage 04 within the core volumetric u net computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"3\" data-node-name=\"体语义瓶颈\" data-node-name-en=\"Stage 04\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_007_3d_u_net', 3)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">04</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">体语义瓶颈</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Stage 04</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">编码器最低尺度建模器官形状与跨切片连续性。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Stage 04 within the core volumetric u net computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"三维转置卷积逐级恢复体素分辨率。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs 3D Up-conv within the core volumetric u net computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"4\" data-node-name=\"3D Up-conv\" data-node-name-en=\"3D Up-conv\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_007_3d_u_net', 4)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">05</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>3D Up-conv</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">三维转置卷积逐级恢复体素分辨率。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs 3D Up-conv within the core volumetric u net computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"同尺度体特征跨越瓶颈拼接到解码器。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs 3D Skip Concat within the core volumetric u net computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"5\" data-node-name=\"3D Skip Concat\" data-node-name-en=\"3D Skip Concat\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_007_3d_u_net', 5)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">06</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>3D Skip Concat</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">同尺度体特征跨越瓶颈拼接到解码器。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs 3D Skip Concat within the core volumetric u net computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"融合体上下文与高分辨率边界。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs 3D Decoder within the core volumetric u net computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"6\" data-node-name=\"3D Decoder\" data-node-name-en=\"3D Decoder\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_007_3d_u_net', 6)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">07</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>3D Decoder</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">融合体上下文与高分辨率边界。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs 3D Decoder within the core volumetric u net computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"1×1×1 卷积输出每体素类别。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Applies Voxel Head to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.\" data-node-idx=\"7\" data-node-name=\"Voxel Head\" data-node-name-en=\"Voxel Head\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_007_3d_u_net', 7)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">08</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Voxel Head</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">1×1×1 卷积输出每体素类别。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Applies Voxel Head to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"只在有标注切片/体素处计算监督损失。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Produces dense 3d voxel-wise segmentation volume via Stage 09.\" data-node-idx=\"8\" data-node-name=\"稀疏监督\" data-node-name-en=\"Stage 09\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_007_3d_u_net', 8)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">09</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">稀疏监督</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Stage 09</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">只在有标注切片/体素处计算监督损失。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Produces dense 3d voxel-wise segmentation volume via Stage 09.</span></div></li>\n</ol>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<!-- Mathematical Formalism Band -->\n<section aria-label=\"3D U-Net Mathematical Formalism\" class=\"spec-math-band\">\n<div class=\"math-meta-col\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">MATHEMATICAL FORMALISM</span>\n<div class=\"math-title-text lang-zh\">核心公式 · 三维卷积、上采样与体积跳接</div>\n<div class=\"math-title-en lang-en\">Core Formalism · Volumetric 3D Convolutions, Upsampling, and 3D Skip Concatenation</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-label=\"3D U-Net：核心公式 · 三维卷积、上采样与体积跳接\" class=\"tex-formula-vector\" role=\"img\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-formula-index=\"7\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"17.865756pt\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" style=\"display:block;width:auto;max-width:100%;height:auto;max-height:96px;margin:0 auto\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"-68.613269 -69.00913 145.589108 17.865756\" width=\"145.589108pt\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><defs><path d=\"M4.714574-1.002467L4.595469-1.101722C4.049571-.47642 3.950317-.397017 3.781585-.397017C3.682331-.397017 3.602927-.47642 3.602927-.595525C3.602927-.754332 3.910615-1.915606 4.24808-3.037178L5.230696-6.729435L5.181069-6.779062C4.655022-6.669882 4.297707-6.61033 3.66248-6.550777V-6.382045C4.208378-6.362194 4.277856-6.332418 4.277856-6.123984C4.277856-5.985028 4.267931-5.955252 4.128975-5.429205L3.692256-3.801436C3.612853-4.218303 3.434195-4.37711 3.047104-4.37711C1.756799-4.37711 .148881-2.511131 .148881-1.022318C.148881-.317613 .545898 .10918 1.19105 .10918C1.865979 .10918 2.302697-.208434 2.977626-1.200976C2.868446-.704705 2.848595-.545898 2.848595-.317613C2.848595-.049627 3.007402 .12903 3.265463 .12903C3.682331 